<title>BAHRAIN: ABC in strategy review.</title>
<headline>ABC in strategy review.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arab Banking Corp (ABC), one of the largest banks in the Arab world, on Wednesday said it has appointed Arthur Andersen to conduct a comprehensive strategy review of the group.</p>
<p>ABC said in a statement it expected the study to result in &quot;renewed focus on key niche markets and a refreshed organisation structure suited to the highly innovative and competitive international market place&quot;.</p>
<p>The move was &quot;part of its mission of consolidating its position as a prime Arab international financial institution&quot;, it said.</p>
</text>
